OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits manslaughter over death
OL,4,Aof Polish national
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted manslaughter over
OL,7,Fthe death of a man who suffered a head
OL,8,Finjury outside a Home Bargains store in
OL,9,FBlackburn.
OL,11,FConnor Doyle, 43, pleaded guilty at
OL,12,FPreston Crown Court over the death of
OL,13,FMarek Krygier after an altercation
OL,14,Foutside the retailer's Byrom Street
OL,15,Fbranch on 27 March.
OL,17,FThe Polish national was seriously
OL,18,Finjured and died in hospital the
OL,19,Ffollowing day, Lancashire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
